{"id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-consistent.md","title":"Metatheoretic Consistency","display":"df-consistent — Metatheoretic Consistency","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-consistent","aliases":["67-df-consistent"],"display":"df-consistent — Metatheoretic Consistency","depends_on":["[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]"],"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-consistent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-consistent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistent — Metatheoretic Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_L\">\\(\\bot_L\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_L\\)</span> 为对任意公理集定义的外部一致性谓词；语言明确时省略下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>。有效呈示上的证明码刻画仅为下游等价形式，不作为本定义的前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\nvdash\\bot_L,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_L(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\nvdash\\bot_L,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_L(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This predicate is used as an external hypothesis in incompleteness theorems; <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d404f437f90ff5f6\" href=\"?note=d404f437f90ff5f6\" title=\"67-df-consistency-statement\">67-df-consistency-statement</a> defines the corresponding internal sentence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为签名，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\bot_L$ 取 [[67-df-formula]]，$T\\vdash\\varphi$ 取 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为签名，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\bot_L$ 取 [[67-df-formula]]，$T\\vdash\\varphi$ 取 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"d404f437f90ff5f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This predicate is used as an external hypothesis in incompleteness theorems; [[67-df-consistency-statement]] defines the corresponding internal sentence.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\nvdash\\bot_L,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_L(T).","display":true}],"bytes":1284,"backlinks":[{"id":"d404f437f90ff5f6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 p.13 定义 Con_σ，并在 p.14 指出对公理集的 PR binumeration 的选择存在记号省略。本条保留呈示依赖。量词 ∀p∈ℕ 是元语言量化，不能放进一个号称对象语言的句子定义；外部一致性仍见 [[67-df-consistent]]。"},{"id":"cd71da66769f105b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"By [[67-df-consistent]], this code-level formulation is extensionally equivalent to $\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)$."},{"id":"83d3bbcffd824285","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq Q$ 是一致的固定原始递归公理呈示，使用本册固定句法与证明编号；$\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)$ 见 [[67-df-consistent]]。"},{"id":"66d369f34bec0254","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$，$\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T$，$\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)$；$T$ 具有固定原始递归公理呈示。$\\mathrm{PA}$ 和一致性分别取 [[67-df-PA]]、[[67-df-consistent]]。"},{"id":"7fdea8f95f2861a9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6fca065df2bf5fac","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq Q$ 使用固定原始递归公理呈示、自然编号与标准证明公式；$\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]、[[67-df-consistent]]。"},{"id":"87f4e115bf0f1121","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 使用固定原始递归公理呈示与标准证明公式，$\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)$ 成立，见 [[67-df-consistent]]。"},{"id":"11cf093a6460aae2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 是外部一致性谓词（[[67-df-consistent]]），不是理论内一致性句。"},{"id":"589664f33390c7ce","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"675f186aa60d7fbc","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)$ 取 [[67-df-sigma1-sound]]；$\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 是 [[67-df-consistent]] 的外部一致性谓词。"},{"id":"16686ac2c7343b20","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orey}_T$ 取 [[67-df-orey-sentence]]；外部一致性谓词 $\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 取 [[67-df-consistent]]。"},{"id":"c99ab4beea350378","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Sigma_1}$ 和 $\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 分别取 [[67-df-partially-conservative]]、[[67-df-consistent]]。"},{"id":"0485e18b7419ccd1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e972b0d757b4f3a3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 取 [[67-df-consistent]]，$\\mathrm{Ros}_T$ 取 [[67-df-rosser-sentence]]。Rosser 固定点的存在性取 [[67-lem-rosser-fixed-point-existence]]，不依赖未提供的第90册文件。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-consistent]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-consistent]]"}],"outgoing":["2035a1f4d72e7df9","573b4c635ea6d91f","d404f437f90ff5f6"]}